                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Great Ramen shop. Not very Japanese style, but rather a mix of both Taiwanese and Japanese.\nYou can choose many different broth. I chose the tomato broth which made the ramen taste like spaghetti sauce. Quite delicious.\nThe karage (fried chicken), tasted quite like Japanese chicken.\nThey also serve unlimited tea drinks, which is good.\nThe indoor dining are is quite spacious, so tons of people can eat-in.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
